```
# Godot-specific ignores
*.import
*.remap
export_presets.cfg
.user
.autosave

# Dependencies
res://addons/
# Note: Godot projects typically don't have standard dependency dirs like node_modules, venv, etc.
# If using external tools, those would need specific entries

# Editor/IDE files
.vscode/
.idea/
*.swp
*.swo
*.tmp

# System files
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db

# Logs
*.log

# Build artifacts (if any)
dist/
build/
target/
```